{
  "title": "TinyVoice",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "A vocal processor",
        "for your voice.",
        "",
        "Three engines:",
        " Vocoder: 13 voice",
        " modes",
        " Synth Voice: a vowel",
        " talking filter for",
        " a synth",
        " Resynth: hard tune",
        " and resynthesis",
        " into a synth",
        "",
        "Pick one on the",
        "Mode page.",
        "All have a Demo."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Setup",
      "children": [
        {
          "title": "Vocoder setup",
          "lines": [
            "Source: your voice.",
            "",
            "Put TinyVoice after",
            "Line In (the built-in",
            "mic works through",
            "it) and sing or",
            "talk.",
            "",
            "Pads play the",
            "carrier in Robot and",
            "Nightcall.",
            "",
            "Gate Auto levels the",
            "input and mutes",
            "silence.",
            "",
            "No sound? Check the",
            "source, Mix and Gate."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Synth Voice setup",
          "lines": [
            "Source: a synth.",
            "",
            "Put TinyVoice after a",
            "synth (a bass, pad or",
            "stab patch) and play.",
            "The vowels shape the",
            "synth's sound.",
            "",
            "Your voice works too,",
            "through Line In.",
            "",
            "Notes below 120 Hz",
            "are thinned, so play",
            "bass patches a bit",
            "higher.",
            "",
            "Demo plays a built-in",
            "funk phrase instead."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Resynth setup",
          "lines": [
            "Source: your voice.",
            "",
            "Put TinyVoice after",
            "Line In and pick",
            "Resynth on the Mode",
            "page. Sing: it hard",
            "tunes to Key and",
            "Scale (Pitch page).",
            "",
            "Pitch MIDI: the pads",
            "set the notes.",
            "",
            "Every control is on",
            "the Remote UI:",
            "move.local:7700"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Vocoder",
      "children": [
        {
          "title": "Pages",
          "lines": [
            "Main: Mode, five",
            "knobs named for the",
            "mode, Mix, Level.",
            "",
            "Pitch: Key, Scale,",
            "Retune, Glide and a",
            "pitch display.",
            "",
            "More: Spread, Tone,",
            "Freeze, Freeze Len,",
            "Gate, Latch, Beauty,",
            "Demo.",
            "",
            "Each mode keeps its",
            "own five knobs."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Modes",
          "children": [
            {
              "title": "Robot",
              "lines": [
                "16-band vocoder.",
                "Pads play the",
                "carrier; with none",
                "held a drone does.",
                "",
                "Knobs 2-6:",
                " 2 Shift",
                " 3 Noise",
                " 4 Ensemble",
                " 5 Beauty",
                " 6 Glide"
              ]
            },
            {
              "title": "Snap",
              "lines": [
                "Hard auto-tune with",
                "a bright space-age",
                "tone. Key and Scale",
                "pick the notes.",
                "Beauty 0 = instant.",
                "",
                "Knobs 2-6:",
                " 2 Formant",
                " 3 Sens",
                " 4 Vibrato",
                " 5 Retune",
                " 6 Beauty"
              ]
            },
            {
              "title": "Chords",
              "lines": [
                "4-voice harmonizer:",
                "root, 3rd, 5th and",
                "octave. Rooted on",
                "the pad you hold,",
                "or in key.",
                "",
                "Knobs 2-6:",
                " 2 Level",
                " 3 Voicing",
                " 4 Humanize",
                " 5 Retune",
                " 6 Beauty"
              ]
            },
            {
              "title": "Prism",
              "lines": [
                "4 harmony lines with",
                "tape warmth, then",
                "Refract: a glassy",
                "shifted shimmer.",
                "",
                "Knobs 2-6:",
                " 2 Voicing",
                " 3 Warmth",
                " 4 Humanize",
                " 5 Refract",
                " 6 Shimmer"
              ]
            },
            {
              "title": "Tape",
              "lines": [
                "Varispeed pitch drop",
                "with wow, flutter,",
                "saturation, hiss.",
                "",
                "Knobs 2-6:",
                " 2 Drop",
                " 3 Flutter",
                " 4 Saturate",
                " 5 Tone",
                " 6 Hiss"
              ]
            },
            {
              "title": "Nightcall",
              "lines": [
                "Talkbox vocoder:",
                "pulse carrier, low",
                "cut, throaty cavity.",
                "Pads or drone carry.",
                "",
                "Knobs 2-6:",
                " 2 Formant",
                " 3 Breath",
                " 4 Rasp",
                " 5 Duty",
                " 6 Cavity"
              ]
            },
            {
              "title": "Scream",
              "lines": [
                "Prank-call voice:",
                "a deep drop and a",
                "big throat. Clean",
                "until Grit is up.",
                "Narrow = phone line.",
                "",
                "Knobs 2-6:",
                " 2 Pitch",
                " 3 Throat",
                " 4 Grit",
                " 5 Narrow",
                " 6 Line"
              ]
            },
            {
              "title": "Dalek",
              "lines": [
                "Frequency shifter,",
                "30 Hz ring mod and",
                "a metal comb.",
                "",
                "Knobs 2-6:",
                " 2 Shift",
                " 3 Ring",
                " 4 Metal",
                " 5 Drive",
                " 6 Width"
              ]
            },
            {
              "title": "HardTune",
              "lines": [
                "Instant pitch snap",
                "to Key/Scale or the",
                "pad you hold.",
                "Amount 0-200 %.",
                "",
                "Knobs 2-6:",
                " 2 Amount",
                " 3 Formant",
                " 4 Vibrato",
                " 5 Glide",
                " 6 Sens"
              ]
            },
            {
              "title": "Harmony",
              "lines": [
                "3 voices: octave",
                "down, 5th up, octave",
                "up; or the shape of",
                "the chord you hold.",
                "",
                "Knobs 2-6:",
                " 2 Lead",
                " 3 Stack",
                " 4 Detune",
                " 5 Grain",
                " 6 Micro"
              ]
            },
            {
              "title": "Walkie",
              "lines": [
                "Handset radio: band,",
                "compressor, clip and",
                "a squelch burst on",
                "open and close.",
                "",
                "Knobs 2-6:",
                " 2 Peak",
                " 3 Drive",
                " 4 Static",
                " 5 Squelch",
                " 6 Band"
              ]
            },
            {
              "title": "Morph",
              "lines": [
                "Formant shift apart",
                "from pitch, into",
                "drive.",
                "",
                "Knobs 2-6:",
                " 2 Throat",
                " 3 Drive",
                " 4 Wobble",
                " 5 Retune",
                " 6 Glide"
              ]
            },
            {
              "title": "Double",
              "lines": [
                "Hard-tuned lead plus",
                "two detuned, slightly",
                "late doubles.",
                "",
                "Knobs 2-6:",
                " 2 Detune",
                " 3 Width",
                " 4 Drift",
                " 5 Retune",
                " 6 Glide"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Pads and Latch",
          "lines": [
            "Only this track's",
            "pads are heard.",
            "",
            "Robot, Nightcall:",
            " carrier notes",
            "Chords, Prism:",
            " the chord root",
            "Snap, HardTune:",
            " the target note",
            "",
            "Latch (More) keeps",
            "the chord after you",
            "let go (Robot,",
            "Chords, Prism,",
            "Nightcall, Harmony).",
            "A press with no pad",
            "held starts a new",
            "chord."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Freeze",
          "lines": [
            "A 16 s punch-in",
            "looper (More).",
            "",
            "Rec: record a take",
            "Loop: play it",
            "Off: live; take kept",
            "",
            "Freeze Len: 1, 2, 4",
            "bars or Free. In bar",
            "mode Rec waits for",
            "the next downbeat,",
            "then stops itself.",
            "",
            "Takes under 50 ms",
            "are ignored."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Gate",
          "lines": [
            "Gate (More):",
            "",
            "Auto: levels the",
            "input and gates",
            "silence.",
            "",
            "-60 to 0 dB: a fixed",
            "threshold."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Demo",
          "lines": [
            "Demo (More): a sung",
            "phrase tours all 13",
            "modes, 4 bars each,",
            "at the Move's tempo.",
            "",
            "Turn Mode to hold",
            "on one mode.",
            "",
            "Voice: vocadito",
            "dataset (Bittner et",
            "al., CC BY 4.0).",
            "See CREDITS.txt."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Synth Voice",
      "children": [
        {
          "title": "Knobs",
          "lines": [
            "1 Vowel: A E I O U",
            "2 Tract: throat size",
            "3 Peak: sharpness",
            "4 Choir: L/R detune",
            " and chorus",
            "5 Breath: noise",
            " and air",
            "6 Attack: onset",
            " swell",
            "7 Release: tail",
            "8 Mix/Drv: wet/dry,",
            " then drive"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Presets",
          "lines": [
            "Pick on the Presets",
            "page:",
            "",
            "Yeah Boy",
            "Robo Talk",
            "Monster Throat",
            "Funky Talkbox",
            "Alien Choir",
            "Vowel Morph Solo"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Audition",
          "lines": [
            "Demo plays an 8-bar",
            "funk phrase. Vowel,",
            "Tract, Peak, Choir",
            "and Mix/Drv move by",
            "themselves.",
            "",
            "Touch one, or pick a",
            "preset, and Demo",
            "stops. Pick a preset",
            "first."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Resynth",
      "children": [
        {
          "title": "Pages",
          "lines": [
            "Main: Transform,",
            "Robotify, Formant,",
            "Synth Mix, Shift,",
            "Octave, Quantize,",
            "Dry/Wet.",
            "Pitch: mode, Key,",
            "Scale, Hold Scale,",
            "range.",
            "Synth: wave, Shape,",
            "Stretch, Warble,",
            "Widen, Smoothing.",
            "Tone: filters, Gate,",
            "De-ess, Sharpen.",
            "Play: Glitch, delay,",
            "notes, gain, Demo.",
            "Cuts out when soft?",
            "Lower Mic Gate (Play)",
            "Notes: Duo, Note 1",
            "and 2, Latch, No Pad.",
            "Presets: first page.",
            "Bank: last page."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Pitch modes",
          "lines": [
            "Scale: snaps to the",
            "nearest note of Key",
            "and Scale (Custom:",
            "a preset's notes).",
            "Hold Scale (on):",
            "presets keep your",
            "Key and Scale; turn",
            "it off to use theirs.",
            "Note: one note (Duo",
            "adds a second).",
            "MIDI: the pads you",
            "hold, two at most,",
            "moved to your voice's",
            "octave. None held:",
            "keeps tuning (No Pad",
            "= Silent mutes).",
            "Latch holds a pad.",
            "Notes page: the two",
            "Note-mode notes,",
            "Latch, No Pad.",
            "",
            "Quantize keeps more",
            "of your vibrato low,",
            "less high."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Synth",
          "lines": [
            "Transform morphs",
            "your voice into the",
            "wave. Synth Mix",
            "blends it with the",
            "tuned voice.",
            "Shift adds a line",
            "in the scale.",
            "Octave: down (-) or",
            "up (+) lines.",
            "Robotify makes the",
            "harmonics exact."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Presets",
          "lines": [
            "Presets page: turn",
            "to audition, press",
            "to keep. Bank page:",
            "Default (30, with",
            "TinyVoice), Imported",
            "(all yours), or by",
            "kind: Tuner, Voco,",
            "Harmony, Synth,",
            "Dryish, Instrument,",
            "Artists, Mine (your",
            "own saves).",
            "Save your own on My",
            "Presets. Demo plays",
            "5 Default presets.",
            "Auto Level (Remote",
            "UI) evens loudness.",
            "Humanoid",
            "presets you own can",
            "be converted on a",
            "computer (the repo's",
            "import script) or",
            "dropped on the",
            "Remote UI page."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Remote UI",
          "lines": [
            "Open move.local:7700",
            "Remote UI, then the",
            "TinyVoice panel.",
            "Every control, the",
            "wave and filter",
            "drawn, a scale",
            "keyboard, and Import",
            "for .baby files."
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
